WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.281
The love letter

00:00:01.093 --> 00:00:02.331
Feynman wrote and

00:00:02.154 --> 00:00:03.074
never sent

00:00:03.606 --> 00:00:05.068
Richard Feynman married

00:00:04.880 --> 00:00:07.308
Arline Greenbaum in 1942

00:00:07.568 --> 00:00:09.490
though lymphatic tuberculosis

00:00:09.502 --> 00:00:10.410
was expected to

00:00:10.222 --> 00:00:11.153
kill her within

00:00:10.965 --> 00:00:11.896
two years

00:00:12.430 --> 00:00:13.196
He worked at

00:00:13.008 --> 00:00:14.222
Los Alamos while

00:00:14.034 --> 00:00:14.800
she lay in

00:00:14.612 --> 00:00:15.873
a sanatorium in

00:00:15.685 --> 00:00:16.557
Albuquerque

00:00:16.696 --> 00:00:19.691
On June 16, 1945

00:00:19.915 --> 00:00:20.788
she died at

00:00:20.599 --> 00:00:21.837
9:21 in the

00:00:21.649 --> 00:00:22.356
evening

00:00:22.886 --> 00:00:23.758
A year and

00:00:23.570 --> 00:00:24.501
a half later

00:00:24.572 --> 00:00:25.303
he wrote her

00:00:25.115 --> 00:00:26.034
a love letter

00:00:26.058 --> 00:00:27.001
and never sent

00:00:26.813 --> 00:00:27.850
it because as

00:00:27.662 --> 00:00:28.404
he put it

00:00:28.629 --> 00:00:29.301
he did not

00:00:29.112 --> 00:00:29.772
know her new

00:00:29.584 --> 00:00:30.338
address

00:00:30.870 --> 00:00:31.884
Full story on

00:00:31.695 --> 00:00:32.591
the dashboard
